  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>🔪 傳說中，許多豬布林入侵了主世界，你可以發現這些戰爭留下的遺跡，擁有獨特的風貌。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>🦴 探索殘骸：探索、尋找、獲取並揭開豬布林過去暗中籌劃的真相。戰利品範例包含：「黑曜石、帶有裝飾的盔甲、武器。使用你的毛刷清理礫石，獲得更珍稀的物品，例如自訂旗幟、藥水、生物頭部、碎片等。」</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#c9f\"><strong>相容世界生成數據包，同樣支援 Paper/Spigot 伺服器。（請務必事先備份，因為 Paper 偶爾會有異常）<br></strong></span><strong>回報問題、提供建議或協助開發，歡迎加入我們的&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fCZQthZJjPc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a> </span>，這裡的氛圍都非常棒！</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/949138580415062017?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord\" alt=\"Discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/632624?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">相容平台</span><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/msMOOMq.png\" width=\"195\" height=\"95\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/hIpLSyga/images/21e58ce2208b2d3a3b8c513156d5605695883245.png\" alt=\"Thumbnail\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/IlBNUql.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3oSlucE.png\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/A5UqBQi.png\"></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/H9WJK65dKjo?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<h3>若想展開一場冒險之旅，結帳時輸入優惠碼「HOPONO」即可享有首月 25% 折扣！❤️</h3>\n<h3><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fhopono\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bisecthosting.com/hopono</a></h3>\n<h3><a href=\"https://discord.gg/CZQthZJjPc\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_64h.png&n=-1\" alt=\"\" width=\"171\" height=\"50\"></a><a hre